
# Main reg exp summary
#  [[:digit:]]{1,}:[1-9][0-9]{0,}$
#
#   Field 1: Numerical value.
#   Field 2: A non zero numerical value
#
# Detailed description
# [[:digit:]]{1,}
#   [[:digit:]]: This is a POSIX character class that matches any decimal digit (0-9).
#   {1,}: This is a quantifier that means "one or more" occurrences of the preceding element.
# [1-9]{1}[0-9]{0,}
#   [1-9]: This matches a single digit from 1 to 9
#   [0-9]{0,}: This matches zero or more occurrences of any digit (0-9).
#   $: This is an anchor that matches the end of the line.
#
%_header
Warehouses:Bops
#
# Multiple lines of results may be present.
#
%_multiples
[[:digit:]]{1,}:[1-9][0-9]{0,}$
